# hypernix.food_processor

4-tier bulk chunking: ChopBlade / SliceBlade / ShredBlade / PureeBlade.

## Documentation pages

- [FoodProcessor](../../#/docs/FoodProcessor) · [MDXL source](pages/FoodProcessor.mdxl)

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `ChopBlade()`

Split the file on ``separator`` and yield each non-empty piece.

### `SliceBlade()`

Fixed-length character slicing with optional overlap. Good for

### `ShredBlade()`

Whitespace-tokenized sliding window.

### `PureeBlade()`

The whole file as one output, with internal whitespace

